HISTORY deselected in the extraction process, the contents of the ith           HISTORY aperture in order j can be found as follows:                            HISTORY lambda=array[*,0,{j-min(orders)}*naps + (i-1)],                         HISTORY flux=array[*,1,{j-min(orders)}*naps + (i-1)],                           HISTORY uncertainty=array[*,2,{j-min(orders)}*naps + (i-1)],                    HISTORY flag=array[*,3,{j-min(orders)}*naps + (i-1)].                           HISTORY                                                                         HISTORY The spectra in the file(s) spectra0030.fits, spectra0031.fits,          HISTORY spectra0032.fits, spectra0033.fits, spectra0034.fits,                   HISTORY spectra0035.fits, spectra0036.fits, spectra0037.fits,                   HISTORY spectra0038.fits, spectra0039.fits, spectra0040.fits,                   HISTORY spectra0041.fits, spectra0042.fits, spectra0043.fits,                   HISTORY spectra0044.fits, spectra0045.fits, spectra0046.fits,                   HISTORY spectra0047.fits, spectra0048.fits, spectra0049.fits,                   HISTORY spectra0057.fits, spectra0058.fits, spectra0059.fits,                   HISTORY spectra0060.fits, spectra0061.fits, spectra0062.fits,                   HISTORY spectra0063.fits, spectra0064.fits, spectra0065.fits,                   HISTORY spectra0066.fits were combined using a robust weighted mean             HISTORY with a sigma threshold of 8.  Aperture 1 modifications: The             HISTORY scale factors were determined using order 5 and are:                    HISTORY 0.967834142976468, 1.0324533528885431, 0.9977247669470137,              HISTORY 0.9644521483860028, 0.9875490177588864, 0.9914104337774634,             HISTORY 0.9963466572185742, 0.9903942361837516, 0.9708044474479259,             HISTORY 1.0132246734615682, 0.9952298372301305, 1.053336859934362,              HISTORY 1.0499458851562868, 0.9803842715884001, 1.0069058421444574,             